cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "DhakaFlow: prediction-aware route optimisation with a V2X-measured communication layer"
message: "If you use this work, please cite it and the upstream papers it builds on."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Ferdouse"
    given-names: "Jannatul"
    affiliation: "Islamic University of Technology"
repository-code: "https://github.com/auth889-ai/thesis"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Traffic forecasting reproduced on real public benchmarks (METR-LA, PEMS-BAY) with
  official upstream configurations, coupled to route optimisation evaluated in a SUMO
  digital twin of the real Dhaka road network, with a federated-learning layer whose
  communication cost is measured from an Eclipse MOSAIC V2X simulation rather than
  assumed analytically.
